0,Monpa people - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monpa_people,"The Monpa people in Tibet live in Lebugou, Cona county. There is a village called Le in Tibet, China where Monpa people are found.Around 9,000 Monpas live in Tibet,[2] in Tsona County, Pêlung in Bayi District, and Mêdog County.","Monpa, Tawang",Sino-Tibetan
